  "slug": "chicken-white-bean-greek-salad-recipe-11736944",
  "name": "This High-Protein Greek Salad Will Be on Repeat All Summer Long",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This white bean and chicken salad is a high-protein take on the classic Greek salad. Make a batch for summer potlucks and BBQs, or whip it up to lunch on all week long.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine beans, tomatoes, chicken, feta, cucumber, onion, olives, red wine vinegar, olive oil, oregano, salt, and black pepper in a large bowl; toss until well mixed. Serve immediately or refrigerate until chilled."
    }
  ],
